  Arcadia-1/virtuoso-bridge-lite
  https://github.com/Arcadia-1/virtuoso-bridge-lite
  Upstream license: MIT. This repository does not bundle or install the bridge.

Reference circuit context:
  R. Schreier et al., Understanding Delta-Sigma Data Converters, 2nd edition,
